  title="Brain tumours: types, symptoms, treatment"
  description="A brain tumour on MRI: what types exist, warning symptoms, what to do after the finding, when to observe and when to operate."
  path="/en/treatment/tumors/brain-tumors/"
  h1="Brain tumours"
  lede="Hearing “brain tumour”, most people panic. But tumours are very different: many grow slowly, and some do not need surgery at all. Here is what types exist, what to watch for and what to do if a tumour is found on MRI."
